hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2057","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Chhota badey ko salaam karey. Aur chalne wala baithey ko. Aur thoda bahut ko. (Bukhari: 6231)"
"2058","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sawaar paidal ko salaam karey. Aur paidal baithey ko. Aur thoda bahut ko. (Bukhari: 6232)"
"2059","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Islam mein behtar kaunsa hai? Aap ne farmaya: Khaana khilaao aur salaam padho jise tum pehchaantey ho aur jise tum nahi pehchaantey. (Bukhari: 6236)"
"2060","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key hujrey mein suraakh se jhaanka jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas kanga tha jiskay sath Aap apna sar khujatey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaash main jaanta ke tum dekhtey ho to main use tumhaari aankh mein ghonp deta. Beshak ijazat nigaah key liye banaai gai hai. (Bukhari: 6241)"
"2061","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Beshak Allah ne Aadam key betey par uska zina ka hissa likha hai. Wo use zaroor paaeyga. To aankh ka zina dekhna hai. Aur zabaan ka zina bolna hai. Aur dil tamanna karta hai aur khwaahish karta hai. Aur sharmgaah usey sacha ya jhootha karti hai. (Bukhari: 6243)"
"2062","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo bachchon key paas se guzrey aur unhey salaam kya. Aur kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisa kartey they. (Bukhari: 6247)"
"2063","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas apne waalid par qarz mein aaya. To main ne darwaaza khatkhataya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Main. To Aap ne farmaya: Main main! Goya Aap ne use naapasand kya. (Bukhari: 6250)"
"2064","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi aadmi ko uski majlis se na uthaaey aur doosra us mein baithay. Lekin kushaada karo aur wusat karo. (Bukhari: 6270)"
"2065","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Kaaba key sehan mein apne haath se aise gutthi lagaaye dekha. (Bukhari: 6272)"
"2066","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum teen ho to do aadmi teesrey key siwa sargoshi na karein yahan tak ke tum logon mein mil jao, isliye ke use ghamgeen karey. (Bukhari: 6290)"
"2067","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Madina mein ghar apne ghar walon par raat ko jala. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unkey muamley ki khabar di gai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye aag tumhaari dushman hai. Phir jab tum so jao to use apne aap se bujha do. (Bukhari: 6294)"
"2068","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apne aap ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath dekha ke main ne apne haath se ghar banaaya jo mujhey baarish se chhupaata hai aur mujhey dhoop se saaya deta hai. Mujh par Allah ki makhlooq mein se kisi ne madad nahi ki. (Bukhari: 6302). Duaon ki kitaab."
